The UCI Phishing Websites dataset, which contains 11,055 instances and 30 features, serves as the primary benchmark for this study. This dataset is well established in phishing detection research and provides a compact, interpretable representation of phishing indicators. Table 5.1 presents the performance of each classifier under each imbalance treatment method on this dataset.

