The test shows that [Model A] made [X] correct predictions that [Model B] missed, while [Model B] made [Y] correct predictions that [Model A] missed. The net advantage of [Z] correctly classified instances in favour of [Model A/Model B] was [large/moderate/small] enough to be statistically significant, confirming that the difference observed in F1-score and PR-AUC is meaningful.

